---

---

<section
  id="top"
  class="relative isolate min-h-[92vh] flex items-center pt-28 md:pt-32 pb-20 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden"
  aria-labelledby="hero-heading"
>
  {/* Background video — pinned inside the hero, scrolls away with the section */}
  <video
    autoplay
    muted
    loop
    playsinline
    preload="auto"
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
  >
    <source src="/hero-bg.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
  </video>

  {/* Soft white wash so the centered copy stays readable, video still shows through */}
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/65"
  ></div>

  <div class="container-page w-full relative">
    <div class="max-w-[820px] mx-auto text-center">
      <h1
        id="hero-heading"
        class="heading-display text-[42px] sm:text-[56px] md:text-[68px] lg:text-[76px] tracking-tightest-3"
      >
        <span class="block hero-line hero-line-1">Make your business <span class="text-accent">AI</span>-ready</span>
        <span class="block hero-line hero-line-2">for 2026 and beyond.</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="hero-line hero-line-3 mt-7 md:mt-9 max-w-[640px] mx-auto space-y-4">
        <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[18px] body-text leading-[1.65]">
          AI is not just a buzzword anymore. Used effectively, it extracts real,
          measurable value from your existing operations. Not every part of your business
          needs to be AI-influenced — but plenty of things can be, from simple workflow
          automation to far more powerful integrations that keep you ahead of the curve.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[16.5px] body-secondary leading-[1.65]">
          AI engagement doesn't need to cost big money. It should be all about your
          business needs, on your timeline, at your scale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-line hero-line-4 mt-10 md:mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/book/" class="btn-primary">
          Book a free consultation
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="w-4 h-4"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/quick-brief/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-text-primary text-text-primary pl-6 pr-5 h-[50px] text-[14.5px] font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 ease-smooth hover:bg-text-primary hover:text-background"
        >
          Send a quick brief
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="w-4 h-4"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            <path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-line hero-line-5 mt-5 md:mt-6 text-[13.5px] md:text-[14px] text-text-secondary">
        No time for a call? A quick brief gets a guaranteed
        <span class="text-text-primary font-semibold">24-hour response</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
